# Native Google sign-in additionally needs iOS/Android-type OAuth client ids.
# Add an iOS app and an Android app to the book-galpi Firebase project
# (Project settings → Your apps), which auto-provisions these — then fill
# them in below. Until then, Google sign-in works on web; the native flow
# will fail at Google's consent screen with a redirect_uri_mismatch.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=
